{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1459717-w20-stepping-sideways-easily","id":1459717,"title":"W20 Stepping Sideways easily","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-09-11T20:40:03-07:00","id":1459717,"title":"W20 Stepping Sideways easily","content":"Greetings,<br /> <br /> Besides having a high Gnosis, the <b>Mercury Rising</b> merit and using the <b>Mirrorshades </b>or the <b>Umbra Claw</b> fetishes, what else can facilitate Stepping sideways easily in most* situations? Is there any gift or other fetishes?<br /> <br /> Current list:<ul><li>Gnosis at high values.</li> <li>Inner Light gift.</li> <li>Mercury Rising merit.</li> <li>Mirrorshades fetish.</li> <li>Reach the Umbra gift.</li> <li>Spirit Pill fetish.</li> <li>Umbra Claws fetish.</li> <li>Wind Incarna totem (Umbral variant).</li> </ul>Thanks,<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> *By most, I mean not depending on a particular location.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 04-26-2024, 09:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-11T22:18:38-07:00","id":1459723,"title":"","content":"I just made a Houserule where you do Dexterity + Permanent Gnosis, against the local Gauntlet level, to step sideways.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Jade Kingdom Warrior","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","name":"Shakanaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"951"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-11T23:50:32-07:00","id":1459728,"title":"","content":"The optional Opening the Way rule might apply depending on what you're looking for. It lets one PC roll for their whole pack, which means your highest Gnosis character is the only one the needs Mirrorshades, and everyone crosses at the same speed so you don't have to worry about some PCs getting over instantly and having to stand around in potentially hostile territory waiting for the rest to get through.<br /> <br /> I don't believe W20 reprinted any of the Rites that could apply (though many of those were too obvious to really apply to &quot;most situations&quot;), or the scant Totem that could help.<br /> <br /> Mages can lower Gauntlet ratings, but that's if you're using the full rules for mages and not abbreviated rules for wizards in a pure WtA game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}